{Id="15114",Name="Gahz'ranka",Story="It is said that if a skilled fisherman were to cast his hook with a very specific bait at Pagle's Pointe, then a terrible creature would emerge from the water to devour them...",Portrait=M.."raids\\zg\\gahzranka-portrait",Frame=M.."raids\\zg\\gahzranka-frame",MapCoordinateX=55.8,MapCoordinateY=36.1,Abilities={{Effect="Gahz'ranka inflicts 850 frost damage to enemies in a cone in front him, stealing their mana and reducing their movement speed for 5 seconds.",Icon="Spell_Frost_FrostNova",Id="21099",Name="Frost Breath"},{Effect="Gahz'ranka slams all target in front of him, dealing 250 physical damage and knocking them back.",Icon="Ability_Devour",Id="24326",Name="Gahz'ranka Slam"},{Effect="Gahz'ranka creates a massive geyser, lauching enemies into the air.\
